OL,3,GNEWSAHomophobic abuse inquiry launched
OL,4,Aafter show cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating a report of
OL,7,Fhomophobic abuse after a theatre
OL,8,Fcancelled a show amid claims an actor
OL,9,Fwas attacked.
OL,11,FA member of Chichester Festival Theatre
OL,12,Ftold the audience shortly before a
OL,13,Fscheduled performance of A Midsummer
OL,14,FNight's Dream on Tuesday that the show
OL,15,Fwould not take place due to an assault
OL,16,Fon a member of the cast.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
