OL,3,GNEWSAHomophobic abuse inquiry launched
OL,4,Aafter show cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe theatre said on Thursday the actor
OL,7,Fwas subjected to "an appallingly
OL,8,Fabusive attack", and was "aggressively
OL,9,Fhounded and physically pursued through
OL,10,Fthe centre of Chichester" before the
OL,11,Fscheduled show.
OL,13,FSussex Police said it was investigating
OL,14,Fa report of homophobic abuse at about
OL,15,F18:00 BST on Tuesday and was treating
OL,16,Fthe incident as a hate crime.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
